<title>JAPAN: Life Corp - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Life Corp - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		127.33		vs	  110.84</p>
<p> Operating	    1.62		vs	    1.76</p>
<p> Current		1.25		vs	    1.27</p>
<p> Net	    636    million	  vs	  668    million</p>
<p> EPS		   11.91 yen	  vs	   12.51 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     53 million	  vs	  53 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.75 yen	  vs	    6.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Life Corp is a supermarket operator.</p>
